OL,3,GNEWSAGrade II-listed windmill returned
OL,4,Ato white after colourful makeover
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn August, Holt apologised to Anglesey
OL,7,Fcouncil and said he did not realise he
OL,8,Fneeded permission but understood he had
OL,9,F"broken the rules".
